  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle undergoes constant acceleration along a straight line. Its speed increases from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> as it travels a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span>. The particle then continues to travel a further distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span> at the same acceleration. Which of the following expressions represents the speed of the particle after it has travelled the total distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2s\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2v - u\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{v^2 + u^2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2v^2 - u^2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\\sqrt{2}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
